#: .\core\views.py:122
msgid "Owner, Basil House"
msgstr "Eigenaar, Basil House"

#: .\core\views.py:122
msgid "We increased table turnover with faster ordering."
msgstr "We hebben de tafelrotatie verhoogd met snellere bestellingen."

#: .\core\views.py:123
msgid "Manager, South Fork"
msgstr "Manager van South Fork"

#: .\core\views.py:123
msgid "Campaigns helped us fill off-peak hours."
msgstr "Campagnes hielpen ons daluren te vullen."

#: .\core\views.py:124
msgid "Founder, Luna Cafe"
msgstr "Oprichter, Luna Cafe"

#: .\core\views.py:124
msgid "Our staff now spends less time taking manual orders."
msgstr ""
"Ons personeel besteedt nu minder tijd aan handmatig bestellingen opnemen."

#: .\core\views.py:127 .\core\views.py:149
msgid "AI menu import"
msgstr "AI-menu-import"

#: .\core\views.py:128 .\core\views.py:150
msgid "Multilingual menus"
msgstr "Meertalige menu's"

#: .\core\views.py:129 .\core\views.py:151
msgid "QR code generation"
msgstr "QR-code genereren"

#: .\core\views.py:130 .\core\views.py:152
msgid "Order management"
msgstr "Bestelbeheer"

#: .\core\views.py:131 .\core\views.py:153
msgid "Campaign engine"
msgstr "Campagne-engine"

#: .\core\views.py:132 .\core\views.py:154
msgid "Daily analytics"
msgstr "Dagelijkse analyses"

#: .\core\views.py:133 .\core\views.py:155
msgid "Category controls"
msgstr "Categoriebeheer"

#: .\core\views.py:134 .\core\views.py:156
msgid "Live availability"
msgstr "Live beschikbaarheid"

#: .\core\views.py:135 .\core\views.py:157
msgid "POS-ready payloads"
msgstr "POS-klare payloads"

#: .\core\views.py:136 .\core\views.py:158
msgid "Mobile-first pages"
msgstr "Mobile-first pagina's"

#: .\core\views.py:137 .\core\views.py:159
msgid "Role-ready panel"
msgstr "Rol-klaar paneel"

#: .\core\views.py:138 .\core\views.py:160
msgid "Conversion focused UI"
msgstr "Op conversie gerichte UI"

#: .\core\views.py:149
msgid ""
"Upload a PDF or photo and we extract your dishes and prices automatically."
msgstr ""
"Upload een PDF of foto en wij halen gerechten en prijzen automatisch eruit."

#: .\core\views.py:150
msgid ""
"Serve your menu in multiple languages and switch by customer preference."
msgstr "Bied uw menu in meerdere talen aan en schakel op klantvoorkeur."

#: .\core\views.py:151
msgid "Generate and download QR codes for tables, takeaway, and delivery."
msgstr "Genereer en download QR-codes voor tafels, afhalen en bezorging."

#: .\core\views.py:152
msgid ""
"Receive, track, and fulfill orders from one dashboard with status updates."
msgstr ""
"Ontvang, volg en verwerk bestellingen vanuit één dashboard met "
"statusupdates."

#: .\core\views.py:153
msgid ""
"Create time-based discounts, happy hours, and target specific categories."
msgstr ""
"Maak tijdgebonden kortingen, happy hours en richt op specifieke categorieën."

#: .\core\views.py:154
msgid "View orders, revenue, and top items with simple charts and exports."
msgstr ""
"Bekijk bestellingen, omzet en topitems met eenvoudige grafieken en exports."

#: .\core\views.py:155
msgid "Organize items into categories and reorder with drag-and-drop."
msgstr "Organiseer items in categorieën en herorden met slepen en neerzetten."

#: .\core\views.py:156
msgid "Mark items as out of stock and hide or show sections by schedule."
msgstr "Markeer items als uitverkocht en verberg of toon secties per schema."

#: .\core\views.py:157
msgid "Send orders to your POS or kitchen display via webhooks or API."
msgstr "Stuur bestellingen naar uw POS of keukendisplay via webhooks of API."

#: .\core\views.py:158
msgid "Menus and checkout are optimized for phones and tablets."
msgstr "Menu's en afrekenen zijn geoptimaliseerd voor telefoons en tablets."

#: .\core\views.py:159
msgid "Invite staff with roles: admin, manager, or view-only."
msgstr "Nodig personeel uit met rollen: admin, manager of alleen-lezen."

#: .\core\views.py:160
msgid "Clean design and clear CTAs to maximize add-to-cart and checkout."
msgstr ""
"Clean design en duidelijke CTA's om winkelwagen en checkout te "
"maximaliseren."

#: .\core\views.py:163
msgid "Can I use my own domain?"
msgstr "Kan ik mijn eigen domein gebruiken?"

#: .\core\views.py:163
msgid ""
"Yes. You can connect a custom domain (e.g. menu.yourrestaurant.com) from the"
" settings panel."
msgstr ""
"Ja. U kunt een eigen domein (bijv. menu.uwrestaurant.com) koppelen via het "
"instellingenpaneel."

#: .\core\views.py:164
msgid "Is there a mobile app for staff?"
msgstr "Is er een mobiele app voor personeel?"

#: .\core\views.py:164
msgid ""
"The panel is fully responsive; you can use it from any browser. Native apps "
"are on our roadmap."
msgstr ""
"Het paneel is volledig responsive; gebruik het vanuit elke browser. Native "
"apps staan op de roadmap."

#: .\core\views.py:165
msgid "How do I print QR codes?"
msgstr "Hoe druk ik QR-codes af?"

#: .\core\views.py:165
msgid ""
"Generate QR codes from the dashboard and download as PNG or SVG. Print on "
"table tents or stickers."
msgstr ""
"Genereer QR-codes vanuit het dashboard en download als PNG of SVG. Druk af "
"op tafelkaartjes of stickers."

#: .\core\views.py:166
msgid "Do you integrate with POS?"
msgstr "Integreert het met POS?"

#: .\core\views.py:166
msgid ""
"We support webhooks and an API so you can push orders to your POS or kitchen"
" display system."
msgstr ""
"We ondersteunen webhooks en een API zodat u bestellingen naar uw POS of "
"keukendisplay kunt sturen."

#: .\core\views.py:173
msgid "Set up your menu"
msgstr "Stel uw menu in"

#: .\core\views.py:173
msgid ""
"Create categories, add dishes with prices and photos, and set availability."
msgstr ""
"Maak categorieën, voeg gerechten toe met prijzen en foto's en stel "
"beschikbaarheid in."

#: .\core\views.py:173
msgid "Drag-and-drop reorder, bulk edit, or import from spreadsheet."
msgstr ""
"Sleep om te herordenen, bewerk in bulk of importeer vanuit een spreadsheet."

#: .\core\views.py:174
msgid "Generate your QR"
msgstr "Genereer uw QR"

#: .\core\views.py:174
msgid ""
"Print QR codes for each table or area. Customers scan to open your menu."
msgstr ""
"Druk QR-codes af voor elke tafel of zone. Klanten scannen om uw menu te "
"openen."

#: .\core\views.py:174
msgid "Download PNG or SVG, print on table tents or stickers."
msgstr "Download PNG of SVG, druk af op tafelkaartjes of stickers."

#: .\core\views.py:175
msgid "Get online orders"
msgstr "Ontvang online bestellingen"

#: .\core\views.py:175
msgid ""
"Customers browse, add to cart, and checkout. You receive and fulfill orders."
msgstr ""
"Klanten bladeren, voegen toe aan winkelwagen en rekenen af. U ontvangt en "
"voert bestellingen uit."

#: .\core\views.py:175
msgid "Optional: connect to POS or kitchen display."
msgstr "Optioneel: verbind met POS of keukendisplay."

#: .\core\views.py:186
msgid "QR menu — customers scan and browse your menu on their phone"
msgstr "QR-menu — klanten scannen en bekijken uw menu op hun telefoon."

#: .\core\views.py:187
msgid "Unlimited menu items and categories"
msgstr "Onbeperkte menu-items en categorieën"

#: .\core\views.py:188
msgid "Unlimited QR codes for tables and takeaway"
msgstr "Onbeperkte QR-codes voor tafels en afhalen"

#: .\core\views.py:189
msgid "Online ordering — guests order and pay from the same link"
msgstr "Online bestellen — gasten bestellen en betalen via dezelfde link."

#: .\core\views.py:190
msgid "Customizable themes to match your brand"
msgstr "Aanpasbare thema's voor uw merk"

#: .\core\views.py:191
msgid "Campaigns & discounts (happy hour, daily specials)"
msgstr "Campagnes en kortingen (happy hour, dagaanbiedingen)"

#: .\core\views.py:192
msgid "Multilingual menu support"
msgstr "Ondersteuning voor meertalig menu"

#: .\core\views.py:193
msgid "Real-time updates — change prices and availability instantly"
msgstr "Realtime updates — pas prijzen en beschikbaarheid direct aan."

#: .\core\views.py:194
msgid "Basic analytics — see what sells"
msgstr "Basisanalyses — zie wat verkoopt."

#: .\core\views.py:195
msgid "Email & WhatsApp support"
msgstr "Ondersteuning via e-mail en WhatsApp"

#: .\core\views.py:199
msgid "Win more orders"
msgstr "Win meer bestellingen"

#: .\core\views.py:199
msgid ""
"Guests order directly from the QR menu. No waiting for staff—faster turnover"
" and higher revenue."
msgstr ""
"Gasten bestellen direct via het QR-menu. Geen wachten op personeel — "
"snellere rotatie en hogere omzet."

#: .\core\views.py:200
msgid "Look professional"
msgstr "Zie er professioneel uit"

#: .\core\views.py:200
msgid ""
"A clean digital menu and your own domain build trust. Stand out from "
"competitors still using paper."
msgstr ""
"Een strak digitaal menu en uw eigen domein wekken vertrouwen. Onderscheid u "
"van concurrenten die nog papier gebruiken."

#: .\core\views.py:201
msgid "One subscription, everything included"
msgstr "Eén abonnement, alles inbegrepen"

#: .\core\views.py:201
msgid ""
"No per-order fees or hidden costs. One annual fee covers menu, ordering, and"
" support."
msgstr ""
"Geen kosten per bestelling of verborgen kosten. Eén jaartarief dekt menu, "
"bestellingen en support."

#: .\core\views.py:202
msgid "Launch in minutes"
msgstr "Lanceer in minuten"

#: .\core\views.py:202
msgid ""
"Add your dishes, print a QR code, and go live. No IT or design skills "
"needed."
msgstr ""
"Voeg gerechten toe, druk een QR-code af en ga live. Geen IT- of "
"ontwerpkennis vereist."

#: .\core\views.py:205
msgid "What is included in the price?"
msgstr "Wat is bij de prijs inbegrepen?"

#: .\core\views.py:205
msgid ""
"Everything: QR menu, online ordering, unlimited items and QR codes, "
"campaigns, custom domain option, themes, and support. One annual "
"subscription, no per-order fees."
msgstr ""
"Alles: QR-menu, online bestellen, onbeperkte items en QR-codes, campagnes, "
"eigen domein-optie, thema's en support. Één jaarabonnement, geen kosten per "
"bestelling."

#: .\core\views.py:206
msgid "Is there a free trial?"
msgstr "Is er een gratis proefperiode?"

#: .\core\views.py:206
msgid ""
"Yes. Start with a free trial to build your menu and test ordering. No card "
"required until you go live."
msgstr ""
"Ja. Start met een gratis proefperiode om uw menu op te bouwen en "
"bestellingen te testen. Geen kaart nodig tot u live gaat."

#: .\core\views.py:207
msgid "Why 19% VAT?"
msgstr "Waarom 19% btw?"

#: .\core\views.py:207
msgid ""
"We are VAT-registered in the EU. If you are in the EU and liable for VAT, a "
"19 percent VAT charge is added at checkout (total €238/year). If you are "
"outside the EU or VAT-exempt, the amount may differ."
msgstr ""
"Wij zijn btw-plichtig in de EU. Bent u in de EU en btw-plichtig, dan komt "
"19% bij afrekenen (totaal €238/jaar). Buiten de EU of vrijgesteld kan het "
"bedrag afwijken."

#: .\core\views.py:244
msgid "Security check failed. Please reload the page and try again."
msgstr ""
"Beveiligingscontrole mislukt. Herlaad de pagina en probeer het opnieuw."

#: .\core\views.py:247 .\core\views.py:291
msgid "Thanks. If your message needs a reply, we will contact you."
msgstr ""
"Bedankt. Als uw bericht een antwoord nodig heeft, nemen wij contact met u "
"op."

#: .\core\views.py:250
msgid "Security check failed. Please try again."
msgstr "Beveiligingscontrole mislukt. Probeer het nog eens."

#: .\core\views.py:259
msgid "Please check the form fields and try again."
msgstr "Controleer de formuliervelden en probeer het opnieuw."

#: .\core\views.py:262
msgid "Please complete all fields."
msgstr "Vul alle velden in."

#: .\core\views.py:267
msgid "Too many messages. Please try again later."
msgstr "Te veel berichten. Probeer het later nog eens."

#: .\core\views.py:270
msgid "Please wait before sending another message."
msgstr "Wacht voordat u nog een bericht stuurt."

